=E3o.</font></small></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art19"></a>Art. 19. As intima=E7=F5es ser=E3o feitas na forma
