al">Da Revelia</font></small></b></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art20"></a>Art. 20. N=E3o comparecendo o demandado =E0
