<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art24=A72"></a>=A7
2=BA O =E1rbitro ser=E1 escolhido dentre os ju=EDzes leigos.</font></small>=
</p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art25"></a>Art. 25. O =E1rbitro conduzir=E1 o processo com
