 para
homologa=E7=E3o por senten=E7a irrecorr=EDvel.</font></small></p>

<p align=3D"CENTER" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><b><small><font face=3D"Ari=
al">Se=E7=E3o IX</font></small></b></p>

<p align=3D"CENTER" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><b><small><font face=3D"Ari=
al">Da Instru=E7=E3o e Julgamento</font></small></b></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art27"></a>Art. 27. N=E3o institu=EDdo o ju=EDzo arbitral,
proceder-se-=E1 imediatamente =E0 audi=EAncia de instru=E7=E3o e julgamento=
, desde que n=E3o
resulte preju=EDzo para a defesa.</font></small></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art27p"></a>Par=E1grafo =FAnico. N=E3o sendo poss=EDvel a sua
realiza=E7=E3o imediata, ser=E1 a audi=EAncia designada para um dos quinze =
