cientes, desde logo, as partes e testemunhas eventualmente presentes.</font=
></small></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art28"></a>Art. 28. Na audi=EAncia de instru=E7=E3o e
