interrup=E7=E3o da audi=EAncia.</font></small></p>

<p align=3D"CENTER" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><b><small><font face=3D"Ari=
al">Se=E7=E3o X</font></small></b></p>

<p align=3D"CENTER" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><b><small><font face=3D"Ari=
al">Da Resposta do R=E9u</font></small></b></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art30"></a>Art. 30. A contesta=E7=E3o, que ser=E1 oral ou
