</font>
<font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">&nbsp;
<a href=3D"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_Ato2015-2018/2015/Lei/L13=
105.htm#1064">(Reda=E7=E3o dada pela Lei n=BA 13.105, de 2015)</a>&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;
<a href=3D"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_Ato2015-2018/2015/Lei/L13=
105.htm#art1045">(Vig=EAncia)</a></font></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 38px"><small><font face=3D"Arial=
">
<a name=3D"art48p"></a>Par=E1grafo =FAnico. Os erros materiais podem ser
